<section class="py-20 lg:py-28" style="background:#F8FAFC">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold mb-5" style="color:#0F2044">Your Executives Are Ready for AI. Is Your Organization?</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">The companies falling behind on AI aren't failing because they lack ambition, budget, or even technology. They're failing because of five organizational gaps that almost no one talks about.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="space-y-4 mb-12">
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-slate-100">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2" style="color:#0F2044">Gap 1 — Ownership Is Unclear</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600">AI initiatives live in the org chart no-man's-land between IT, Operations, and the C-suite. No one owns it. Nothing ships.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-slate-100">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2" style="color:#0F2044">Gap 2 — Data Exists but Isn't Connected</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600">The raw ingredients for AI are there. But the infrastructure to connect and activate it is missing.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-slate-100">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2" style="color:#0F2044">Gap 3 — Vendor AI Creates Local Optimization</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600">Every vendor's AI solves for their silo. No one is optimizing your whole operation.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-slate-100">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2" style="color:#0F2044">Gap 4 — Custom Builds Are Overestimated</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600">Organizations believe they need bespoke AI models. Most don't. They need better implementation of what already exists.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-slate-100">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2" style="color:#0F2044">Gap 5 — The Automation vs. Reimagination Clarity Gap</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600">Leaders chase quick automation wins when the real opportunity is process redesign.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-2xl p-8 lg:p-10 border-2 mb-8 bg-white" style="border-color:#0F2044">
      <p class="text-lg font-bold text-center" style="color:#0F2044">"AI advantage does not come from advanced models, experimentation volume, or being first to adopt new tools. It comes from disciplined execution."</p>
      <p class="text-center text-slate-600 mt-4 text-sm">— Reboot Ventures research, January 2026</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
